{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL05leHQlMjAlMjgyMDA3JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Next","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wtBOCJBCP0MWNjmBwjMAzbwgtTK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1uPcQNsgZIMRZl07rbIuw7EEtwX.jpg","description":"Las Vegas showroom magician Cris Johnson has a secret which torments him: he can see a few minutes into the future. Sick of the examinations he underwent as a child and the interest of the government and medical establishment in his power, he lies low under an assumed name in Vegas, performing cheap tricks and living off small-time gambling \"winnings.\" But when a terrorist group threatens to detonate a nuclear device in Los Angeles, government agent Callie Ferris must use all her wiles to capture Cris and convince him to help her stop the cataclysm.","releaseInfo":"2007","genres":["Action","Science Fiction","Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.2","runtime":"96 min","cast":["Nicolas Cage","Julianne Moore","Jessica Biel","Thomas Kretschmann","Jim Beaver","Tory Kittles","Peter Falk","Enzo Cilenti"],"director":["Lee Tamahori"],"released":"2007-04-25T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"If you can see the future, you can save it.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Nicolas Cage","character":"Cris Johnson / Frank Cadillac","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y1RtezurZYveYkVNRht7CwEgSYY.jpg"},{"name":"Julianne Moore","character":"Callie Ferris","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3YF19rWusxWfEI59ZM33dFhasRq.jpg"},{"name":"Jessica Biel","character":"Liz Cooper","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u5DzbWKvAzS0M4ZhYqpUR9MZr2M.jpg"},{"name":"Thomas Kretschmann","character":"Mr. Smith","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7M0P39a3CVA22dJyv5YQEkTThU7.jpg"},{"name":"Jim Beaver","character":"Wisdom","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mvawGDw5ge5rxgMKhTSggasOyin.jpg"},{"name":"Tory Kittles","character":"Cavanaugh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185